# One-electron KI sources with charge and magnetic response about a no-spin
# ground state. This does not make the ground state spin polarized.
wannier-koopmans 0 400 1e-7 yes 1e-4 yes 2 yes
wannier-koopmans-spin yes
# Set yes to print k-point/basis listings and every response iteration.
wannier-koopmans-verbose no
wannier-koopmans-response no yes 0.4 8 80 2048 512 4096
include ki-screening-mesh.in
